  dct:description "Ingested 33 source files into 33 assets under https://www.insperity.com/, with IRIs, labels and metadata brought into line with Semantic Governance: Services, Architecture & Integration v1.8 (Draft), Part III. Every asset is at version 0.1.0, Draft. Results: Application business taxonomy vocabulary (716 terms, 46 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Application data domain vocabulary (223 terms, 2 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core party vocabulary (44 terms, 4 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain governance vocabulary (91 terms, 1 conformance error, 0 warnings); Core asset vocabulary (33 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core businessoperations vocabulary (76 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core capability vocabulary (49 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core compliance vocabulary (91 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core domain vocabulary (22 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core event vocabulary (5 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core issue vocabulary (9 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core lifecycle vocabulary (21 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core location vocabulary (22 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core persona vocabulary (46 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core process vocabulary (12 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core product vocabulary (68 terms, 1 conformance error, 0 warnings); Core requirements vocabulary (16 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core role vocabulary (5 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core rules vocabulary (16 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core services vocabulary (95 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core technicalservices vocabulary (207 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core time vocabulary (25 terms, 2 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core valuestream vocabulary (19 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain facilities vocabulary (152 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain finance vocabulary (144 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain humanresource vocabulary (82 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain informationtechnology vocabulary (139 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain legal vocabulary (72 terms, 1 conformance error, 0 warnings); Domain marketing vocabulary (81 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain procurement vocabulary (29 terms, 1 conformance error, 0 warnings); Domain sales vocabulary (54 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain security vocabulary (137 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Domain supplychain vocabulary (46 terms, 1 conformance error, 0 warnings). 2 files were skipped: core-party.ttl, domain-governance.ttl."@en ;
